MEGA65 (model $03), 384K chip RAM, 8MB attic RAM

>10 N%=0:ON COLLISION PROChit
>20 PRINT COLLIDE(0);COLLIDE(63)
>30 ?&6ED=?&6ED OR 16:PRINT "a":PRINT "b"
>40 DI:?&6ED=?&6ED OR 16:PRINT "c":EI:PRINT "d"
>50 ON COLLISION OFF:?&6ED=?&6ED OR 16:PRINT "e ";N%:END
>60 DEF PROChit:N%=N%+1:PRINT "hit ";N%:ENDPROC
>LIST 10,20
   10 N%=0:ON COLLISION PROChit
   20 PRINT COLLIDE(0);COLLIDE(63)
>RUN
        -1-1
hit 1
a
b
c
hit 2
d
e 2
>
